  "title": "Share Your Talent",
  "content_html": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"3112\" class=\"elementor elementor-3112\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec8c58e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ec8c58e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2421001 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2421001\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e4e2ff7 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e4e2ff7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Share Your Talent</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8096cf3 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8096cf3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Every person has unique gifts, skills, and expertise that can make education richer and more meaningful. When you share your<br> talent, you open doors of opportunity for students and strengthen the entire school community.</p>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e60c7e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5e60c7e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f447e20 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f447e20\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ways to Share Your Talent</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0fc7a83 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0fc7a83\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-318fe5d e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"318fe5d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fcea48f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"fcea48f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"164\" height=\"183\" src=\"https://scupstatefoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Layer-70.pngl_.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-3118\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cecad2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3cecad2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Professional Expertise</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45f2333 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"45f2333\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Present on your field of work or a topic of interest. Professionals—from engineers to artists—help students connect classroom learning to real-world applications.</p>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f69b70e e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f69b70e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dac4e6a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"dac4e6a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"164\" height=\"183\" src=\"https://scupstatefoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Layer-71.pngo_.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-3117\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6008649 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6008649\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Academic Partnerships</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c5db48f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c5db48f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Collaborate with higher education professors who bring their research into our schools, creating hands-on, cutting-edge learning experiences for students.</p>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1868a22 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1868a22\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f3339d e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2f3339d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8525b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f8525b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"164\" height=\"183\" src=\"https://scupstatefoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Layer-72-1.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-3116\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-03f1c1a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"03f1c1a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Leadership &amp; Coaching</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0521b5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0521b5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Guide a student club, lead a workshop, or provide career coaching. Your leadership can help students discover passions and prepare for the future.</p>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-566e94a e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"566e94a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6134906 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6134906\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"164\" height=\"183\" src=\"https://scupstatefoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Layer-73.pnghgjg.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-3115\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b216a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1b216a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Creative &amp; Practical Skills </h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-939b0bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"939b0bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Share talents in the arts, trades, technology, or entrepreneurship. From music and design to carpentry or coding, your skills can ignite curiosity and build confidence.</p>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b5b2b61 e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b5b2b61\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a7dcb1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1a7dcb1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-72dfa7b e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"72dfa7b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5646d91 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5646d91\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why It Matters</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e8fcd8 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"9e8fcd8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Students see real-world pathways that inspire their own goals.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Teachers gain new perspectives, tools, and support.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Our community grows stronger when everyone brings their        unique gifts to the table</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5642d57 e-con-full elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5642d57\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac7c525 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ac7c525\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de7717a e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"de7717a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8d371ff elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8d371ff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Take the Next Step</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ccb3ef elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2ccb3ef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Ready to make a lasting impact? Complete our <strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Volunteer Interest Form</span></strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-33e6172 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"33e6172\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\"><iframe\n    src=\"https://link.takepart.co/widget/form/pMooAVJgXX4a0wPdtQcF\"\n    style=\"width:100%;height:100%;border:none;border-radius:0px\"\n    id=\"inline-pMooAVJgXX4a0wPdtQcF\" \n    data-layout=\"{'id':'INLINE'}\"\n    data-trigger-type=\"alwaysShow\"\n    data-trigger-value=\"\"\n    data-activation-type=\"alwaysActivated\"\n    data-activation-value=\"\"\n    data-deactivation-type=\"neverDeactivate\"\n    data-deactivation-value=\"\"\n    data-form-name=\"form 3 \"\n    data-height=\"555\"\n    data-layout-iframe-id=\"inline-pMooAVJgXX4a0wPdtQcF\"\n    data-form-id=\"pMooAVJgXX4a0wPdtQcF\"\n    title=\"form 3 \"\n        >\n</iframe>\n<script src=\"https://link.takepart.co/js/form_embed.js\"></script></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
